  - Fixed stdout print lowering so prints execute once instead of every cycle.
  - Normalized simulator float text output (NaN, +Inf) to match Go.
  - Added a simulator-side fallback for dfsin because that benchmark currently relies on native Go float64 math not lowered by the hardware path.

